Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 16:07:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(server): support paginated Codex reverts and recover
 failed file rollbacks

Use native turn boundaries when Codex rejects legacy rollback for paginated history. Capture current files before reverting and restore them if the provider rewind fails.

Validation: 77 focused tests, server typecheck, targeted lint, server bundle build, real Codex 0.153.4 protocol probe, and isolated packaged Electron startup.
